WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:12.220
Well well well. I’m surprised you two came back. I thought I might’ve scared you a little too much last time.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.305
Mm, nothing we can’t handle, right?

00:00:16.182 --> 00:00:19.811
Yeah, nothin’ like a few nightmares to get you through the week. 

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:25.442
Oh, well good. Because tonight I’ve got a tale that’s gonna leave you both totally trembling.

00:00:25.442 --> 00:00:28.194
Ooooooh

00:00:28.695 --> 00:00:34.659
So Los Angeles has a lot of bright lights and beautiful people.

00:00:34.659 --> 00:00:42.709
But in L.A.’s dark underground, there’s a secret turf war that’s been raging for centuries between humans… and vampires. 

00:00:44.794 --> 00:00:46.046
Ohh boy.

00:00:47.005 --> 00:00:51.509
After so much bloodshed, the two sides signed a truce that lasted a hundred years. 

00:00:51.509 --> 00:00:55.305
The terms were simple: vampires remain unseen from humans, 

00:00:55.305 --> 00:00:59.267
don’t drink from the unwilling, and stay out of Boyle Heights.

00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:03.271
But some truces just weren’t meant to last.

00:01:03.271 --> 00:01:06.858
This story’s called ‘Night Teeth’

00:01:11.738 --> 00:01:16.993
Boyle Heights is a neighbourhood in east L.A. run by Jay Perez and his crew.

00:01:16.993 --> 00:01:20.121
They protect the truce and keep the vampires out.

00:01:20.121 --> 00:01:24.584
But one night, a scheming vampire named Victor breaks the truce.

00:01:24.584 --> 00:01:29.005
He busts into Boyle Heights, kills some of Jay’s crew, and kidnaps his girlfriend, Maria. 

00:01:29.005 --> 00:01:30.757
Maria!

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:32.842
This not only enrages Jay

00:01:32.842 --> 00:01:36.763
It pisses off the bosses of L.A.’s vampire underworld.

00:01:36.763 --> 00:01:41.810
They’ve grown rich and powerful during the truce, and wanna punish Victor too.

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.771
Which is exactly what he planned for.

00:01:44.771 --> 00:01:46.689
Victor wants all that heat?

00:01:46.689 --> 00:01:48.316
Oh ya.

00:01:50.235 --> 00:01:55.657
Now on the non-bloodsucking side of town, there’s Jay’s brother Benny.

00:01:55.657 --> 00:01:59.661
Benny’s a sweet college kid, who doesn’t even know vampires exist. 

00:01:59.661 --> 00:02:05.125
While Jay prepares to save Maria, Benny takes his place driving for their limo company.

00:02:05.125 --> 00:02:09.462
Little does Benny know, he’s cruising right into Victor’s plan.

00:02:10.296 --> 00:02:16.427
While everyone’s after him, Victor’s got his vampire girlfriend, Zoe, and her vampire BFF Blaire,

00:02:16.427 --> 00:02:23.143
going around L.A. to kill the 5 bosses, then their driver, who’s supposed to be Jay. 

00:02:23.143 --> 00:02:28.314
We’re hitting every single one of these parties tonight and we need to get to the last stop by morning. 

00:02:28.314 --> 00:02:31.651
That’s non-negotiable. Are we clear?

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:32.485
Ya.

00:02:32.485 --> 00:02:35.446
And if Victor takes out all his enemies in one night

00:02:35.446 --> 00:02:36.781
He runs Los Angeles.

00:02:36.781 --> 00:02:43.580
Exactly. Victor planned to break the truce, kill everyone, and take over.

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:47.584
As for Benny? He’s in the scariest spot ever.

00:02:47.584 --> 00:02:52.755
Unknowingly driving around two vicious vampire assassins. 

00:02:52.755 --> 00:03:00.805
On an early stop, Benny finds a bag of bloody cash in the car. He goes looking for Zoe and Blaire. Ooops - 

00:03:03.057 --> 00:03:03.766
Hey.

00:03:04.642 --> 00:03:05.685
Heh.. Hey

00:03:07.729 --> 00:03:08.688
This isn’t what it looks like.

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:10.231
Uh ok then I’ll just –

00:03:14.068 --> 00:03:19.282
Oh my god. He’s shaking. I love it when they shake.

00:03:19.866 --> 00:03:22.327
Daniel? Daniel! 

00:03:24.412 --> 00:03:26.456
It’s ok it’s just a story.

00:03:26.456 --> 00:03:28.708
Uh, ya for sure, I’m, I’m into it.

00:03:28.708 --> 00:03:30.793
Uh, we can see that.

00:03:30.793 --> 00:03:31.961
So what happens next?

00:03:31.961 --> 00:03:34.923
Oh I can’t give away the ending. Netflix would flip.

00:03:36.466 --> 00:03:39.177
Dude, what are you doing?

00:03:39.177 --> 00:03:42.972
Night… teeth… spoilers.

00:03:42.972 --> 00:03:45.725
Dude! Just go watch it. 

00:03:47.727 --> 00:03:49.562
Unless of course,

00:03:52.023 --> 00:03:56.819
you’re too scared. Hahahaha

